<title>UK: Council of Europe sets $160 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Council of Europe sets $160 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Yamaichi International (Europe) and Taiheiyo Europe Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COUNCIL OF EUROPE</p>
<p> AMT    $160 MLN	COUPON     5.33	MATURITY    23.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  S-26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.30	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NOTES    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AAA   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE BORROWERS DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
